ation","target":"root-cause-correlation","line":72},{"title":"Configure Root cause correlation alerts","target":"configure-rcc-alerts","line":74},{"title":"Use the Root cause analysis history","target":"utilizing-rcc-reports-perform-root-cause-analysis","line":76},{"title":"Monitoring instance health with Instance Observer","target":"io-overview","line":79},{"title":"Performance insights in user-configurable dashboard","target":"io-performance-insights","line":83},{"title":"Root cause correlation","target":"root-cause-correlation","line":84},{"title":"Configure Root cause correlation alerts","target":"configure-rcc-alerts","line":85},{"title":"Use the Root cause analysis history","target":"utilizing-rcc-reports-perform-root-cause-analysis","line":86},{"title":"Monitoring instance health with Instance Observer","target":"io-overview","line":87},{"title":"Performance","target":"instance-observer-performance","line":88}],"metadata":{"title":"Generative AI powered Root cause analysis","description":"Root cause analysis in Instance Observer provides automated detection and summarization of issues. It includes built-in root cause correlation and root cause summary using a large language model \\(LLM\\), which helps reduce troubleshooting time, improve incident transparency, and generative AI driven root cause recommendation by analyzing similar historical incidents.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/impact/generative-ai-root-cause-anal.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":3,"keywords":["Generative AI","root cause analysis","Telemetry signals"],"breadcrumb":["Monitoring instance health with Instance Observer","Platform Health","Using Impact","Impact"],"tags":["#impact","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/impact/generative-ai-root-cause-anal.md"},
